[14282]={"'Here to capture me, are you? I'd like to see you try! The likes of you are no match for us.'","Húnbrit has appeared nearby in Fushum Raus.\
\
You should speak with Húnbrit now that Dour Hal has been subdued.","Húnbrit has asked you to capture a half-orc who may have information about the movements of the enemy.","Speak with Húnbrit","Dour Hal can be found in Fushum Raus.\
\
You should do your best to capture Dour Hal and haul him in for questioning.","Capture Dour Hal for questioning","Wanted for Questioning","You have subdued Dour Hal","'Well done, ${PLAYER}! I will take this one to the jail at once. Perhaps we can get some information out of him.'","'I believe these half-orcs are up to something, sneaking so close to Grimslade as they do. I would like to capture one and take him for questioning.\
\
'I will join you inside -- you should whistle for me when you've found a suitable prisoner, and I will take him to the jail in Grimslade.'"},
[14286]={"Many kinds of insects and spiders can be found in Lhingris.\
\
You should defeat spiders and insects.","Defeated enemies in Lhingris (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat enemies in Lhingris (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Wanted: Spiders Dead!","An angry note hangs on the board, signed by Atli Spider-bane:\
\
'Wanted: Spiders Dead!\
If you travel into Lhingris, kill all the Shelob-spawn you can find! This includes all spider-kind and any other dangerous insects.'","Atli Spider-bane has requested that any adventurers travelling to Lhingris should destroy all the spiders they come across."},
[14289]={"'Con sus filas cada vez más diezmadas, no pasará mucho tiempo antes de que los orcos de Moria no sean más que un recuerdo en esta zona. Tus esfuerzos son ejemplares, ${PLAYER}, y serás conocido en estas salas como un héroe para todos.\
\
'Te doy las gracias por todo lo que has hecho hasta ahora.'","Acechadores de Gazathrug derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Fuerzas reunidas","Derrota a los ejecutores de Gazathrug (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Avar en la Guardia Orca","'El estrado del trono de Igash está patrullado por su guardia de élite. Estos orcos parecen de la misma raza que los que se encuentran por todo Khazad-dûm, pero son más fuertes y mortíferos.\
\
'Debemos ser diligentes al enfrentarnos a estos orcos, no sea que lleven a cabo sus planes de guerra.\
\
'Encontrarás a los orcos más allá de los puentes de la Gran Escalera, al noreste de la Guardia Orca.'","'Sé ${PLAYERNAME:cauteloso[m]|cautelosa[f]} al avanzar por la Gran Escalera y derrota a tantos de estos enemigos como puedas.'","Avar se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, al suroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Debes regresar con Avar para informarle de tu éxito.","Los orcos pueden encontrarse en la Gran Escalera, al noreste de la Guardia Orca.\
\
Avar te ha encargado derrotar a los orcos que custodian el trono de Igash.","Derrota a los acechadores de Gazathrug (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los orcos de Moria mantienen el control de la Gran Escalera y, al frente de ellos, se encuentran Igash el Fanático y su Devoto. Junto a ellos marcha una hueste de temibles orcos procedentes del corazón de Moria.","Ejecutores de Gazathrug derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[14290]={"Destruye las cajas de comida de montañés (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Montañeses de Angmar siguieron al ejército orco a través de Ram Dúath hasta las Quebradas del Norte y establecieron un campamento cerca de la entrada del paso. Estos montañeses mantienen abierto el paso desde Angmar.","Los Montaraces de Esteldín no están preparados para enfrentarse a una fuerza así de Ram Dúath, pues los montañeses están bien armados y equipados.\
\
Debes encontrar y destruir sus armas, escudos y reservas de comida. Esto puede retrasar el avance de los montañeses lo suficiente para impedirles montar un ataque importante.","Completado","Cajas de comida de montañés destruidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Guerra y hambruna","Las reservas de comida, armas y escudos se encuentran en la parte norte del campamento de los montañeses, al noreste de Esteldín.\
\
Debes destruir las reservas de comida, armas y escudos de los montañeses, afectando su capacidad para hacer la guerra eficazmente.","Destruye el estante de armas de montañés (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Estante de armas de montañés destruido (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Encontraste y destruiste las armas, armaduras y reservas de comida de los montañeses para frenar su avance y su capacidad de formar un verdadero ejército. Has prestado un gran servicio a los Montaraces de Esteldín.","Estante de escudos de montañés destruido (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destruye el estante de escudos de montañés (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[14291]={"'I was chosen by both my people -- the refugees for Torsbury -- and the townsfolk of Stoke to speak for them. I believe we must first provision the town for siege before aught else.\
\
'But perhaps that is a decision best left to the Reeve and her advisors in council.'","Ordlac is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should wait for Ordlac's advice to be heard.","Grimmar and Ordlac are in the Mead Hall of Stoke. Baldmund is at the inn in the north-eastern part of Stoke. Dudsig is at the Oserley encampment outside the north-east gate of Stoke.\
\
Reeve Fríthild has asked you to speak with the leaders of the forces at Stoke and learn what their advice for her would be.","Talk to Grimmar","Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should return to Fríthild with the town leaders' advice.","'Ah, ${PLAYER}, my friend! I have heard how you fared at Torsbury and grieve Tordag's loss. However, we must not lose heart and must put aside sorrow... there are glorious battles to be fought!\
\
'I must consider our current situation carefully. There is much that needs to be done ere we make a final decision. Return to me in a while, and I will speak my mind more openly. Good day, my friend!'","'It is not my place to say what the Reeve should do. If it were I, I would strike at the heart of the foe, but it is not.\
\
'If the Reeve wishes to be advised, let her call a council.'","Talk to Baldmund","'Thank, you, ${PLAYER}. I wished to learn something of the minds of my advisors before calling a council, and you have helped me do so.\
\
'Prepare yourself... the Council of Stoke will soon be called to session.'","Talk to Fríthild","Talk to Dudsig","Talk to Ordlac","War is Coming","Aided the leaders of Stoke (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'Clearly, we should shore up our defences and prepare for the coming siege. However, it is not my decision to make. I would advise Reeve Fríthild to call a council of war. It may be that Thane Ordlac will have some insights that will help.'","Completed Ordlac's Advice","Complete Ordlac's Advice","After receiving the Dunlending token you brought her, Fríthild is concerned that the scope of the invasion from the west is far greater than she first believed.","Baldmund, Grimmar, Ordlac, and Dudsig have need of your services. You should give them your aid.","DNT -- Will not be seen","Aid the leaders of Stoke (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'${PLAYER}, it is clear that Saruman the White holds sway over the Dunlendings as well. I fear they intend to sweep through the Acres and fall upon Kingstead and Edoras. We must prepare to stand as a foil to that invasion.\
\
'If you would, speak with the leaders in the city and learn what advice they would give. Captain Grimmar and Thane Ordlac are, of course, present here, but I would have you speak with Baldmund, the leader of the refugees from Torsbury, and Ordlac's captain Dudsig. Baldmund may be found at the inn in the north-east part of town, and Dudsig is at the Oserley encampment outside the north-east gate.'"},
[14292]={"Speak with Mizâdi in Kûr Anzar.","Deliver Usanâb's final message to Mizâdi in Kûr Anzar","Deposit supplies in the waggon outside the back gate.","Deliver Amalíbi's message to Mizâdi","'This is an evil I dared not believe exist. We will gather all the supplies and Subuzûri and drive him from Imhûlar. I will not hide behind these walls. I will not subject the people of Kûr Anzar to more bloodshed. We will meet him on the open field.\
\
'I have need of you once more, ${PLAYER}. We will need to gather weapons and whatever supplies you can find here in Kûr Anzar.\
\
'Oh, there is another messenger here - what do they want? Could you find out, friend?'","'Excellent. Thank you for your help. We will let the soldiers sleep tonight. Tomorrow, we ride out to meet Bârshud in battle. I do grow weary of war, ${PLAYER}, but nonetheless it has become my ready companion.'","War is Coming to Imhûlar","Speak with the messenger from Khûd Zagin near the back gate.","Speak with the messenger from Khûd Zagin near the back gate","Gather fallen weapons for the Subuzûri and provisions for the waggons going south from around Kûr Anzar.","'Please, give this message to the Shâra. There is word from Khûd Zagin. Amalíbi requests aid against a great many Ordâkhai excursions - we are being overrun!'","'Please thank the Shâra for seeing me, though Amalíbi will be disappointed in the Shâra's answer. We of the Khûd will look after our own. Apparently Imhûlar will as well.'","'I cannot think to provide aid now - our troubles are numerous as well. Tell her to tell Amalíbi we cannot aid them now. Imhûlar needs to look after their own in this moment. We have nothing for greater Shagâna.'","Gathered provisions for the waggons going south (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gathered fallen weapons for the Subuzûri (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Deliver Usanâb's final message to Mizâdi in Kûr Anzar.","Gather provisions for the waggons going south in Kûr Anzar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gather fallen weapons for the Subuzûri in Kûr Anzar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Anything in the Khûd will have to wait. We need to get the Subuzûri all the weapons we can find and the waggons loaded with supplies for heading south. If this Bârshud wants war, he shall have it.'","Deposit supplies in the waggon outside the back gate","Speak with Usanâb from Khûd Zagin.","Speak with Usanâb from Khûd Zagin","Deliver Amalíbi's message to Mizâdi.","Speak with Mizâdi in Kûr Anzar","Nimasi is a traitor to Mizâdi, leading you right into Bârshud's trap. You should now aid Mizâdi in preparing for battle with Bârshud."},
[14293]={"'Listen to me carefully ${PLAYER}, the tower of Dol Guldur is our ultimate objective, but it is not fated to fall to us this day. We have not the power to bring down those walls -- not as long as the Eye of Sauron is turned towards Lothlórien -- and soon Mirkwood will be overrun with Enemy reinforcements.\
\
'We are here to draw the enemy's ire and to inflict as grievous a wound as we may before we are driven back across the Anduin. The Orcs of Dol Guldur will eventually fall upon the Golden Wood, but we can and will delay that day.\
\
'Thus our true goal here is to destroy as much of the garrison of Gathbúrz as possible before then: soldiers, supplies, leadership...whatever we can lay to ruin before we are forced to retreat. Every Orc you slay here is one less to ford the Anduin when they come against Lothlórien in the coming days.'","'Well fought, ${PLAYER}. The garrison of Gathbúrz is disorganized and vulnerable. You can inflict many casualties there while the Orcs vainly attempt to drive us off of this hill.\
\
'Look to your own survival, though: we cannot afford to lose many, or we will find ourselves overwhelmed ere our task is complete.'","Rodelleth is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
You should return to Rodelleth with news of your success.","Orcs can be found throughout Gathbúrz.\
\
Rodelleth has bidden you lay waste to the Orc-soldiers garrisoning Gathbúrz, to hinder their own imminent assault upon Lothlórien.","Talk to Rodelleth in Thangúlhad","Defeat Orcs in Gathbúrz (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","War of Attrition","The battle upon the slopes below Dol Guldur rages fiercely. As the Malledhrim attempt to lay siege to its walls, the Orcs of Gathbúrz launch one counterattack after another in an attempt to drive them back.","Defeated Orcs in Gathbúrz (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The foul Orcs of Dol Guldur dare tread upon this ground, once the home of Elves...for that, they must perish.'"},
[14296]={"Defeated Orcs of Mordor (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I do not like the presence of these Orcs so near Floodwend! Something must be done.'","Nîn-stazg is south-east of Floodwend, just out of sight of the town's walls.\
\
You should defeat Orcs at Nîn-stazg to thin their ranks.","'My lady Etta has sent us to protect the Thane. He should not go into battle, but he may observe the battle from here, should he wish it.'","War-mongering Slaves","The forces of Mordor will employ their Orc-slaves for any task, be it soldiers in war or mindless workers to chop wood and assemble weapons. As long as the Orcs endure, the Enemy will never cease to have power.","Nîn-stazg is full of Orcs from Mordor, all working hard to build a deadly offence to be railed against Floodwend.","Defeat Mordor Orc-workers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado"},
[14297]={"Defeat Arataus","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Arataus and his band of riders roam the plains on the eastern side of The Fallows.","Núrzum has been defeated, but the enemy persists throughout much of Wildermore.","The Fallows farmland is safer now that Arataus has been taken care of, thanks to you. The people of Forlaw appreciate your efforts.","Warband II: Arataus","Completado","You have defeated Arataus","'Hail, ${PLAYER}! You assisted in defeating Núrzum, but the enemy has not given up. They still roam our lands and lurk in the shadows.\
\
'The enemy is especially strong in the Fallows today. Go there, and show them that Wildermore will endure!'"},
